  "description": "The 12 Guardian Spirits (Bangjeongsa), who have taken human form, use the “Heavenly Scales”, the scales of the gods, to measure the weight of the victim’s suffering, known as “Red Suffering,” and the perpetrator’s suffering, known as “Black Suffering,” and impose appropriate punishment accordingly. “The scales must be true, and the weight of sin and punishment must be equal.” A fantasy human drama about “sin and punishment” featuring the 12 Bangjeongsa, who punish human sins in accordance with Heaven’s decree!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
